 f"Appliances remain on the counter. The 5 mm occupancy grid, restricted to original solid countertop/rim surfaces and with 10 mm expansion around stored/fixed objects, leaves a largest clear front-strip rectangle X=[{xy[0]:.3f},{xy[1]:.3f}], Y=[{xy[2]:.3f},{xy[3]:.3f}] m, area **{free['area_m2']:.4f} m²**. The open sink is excluded. At 80 mm depth this is a rim strip; a full human prep bay has not been established, and the selected robot park remains rejected. [Measured counter/arm envelopes](../../sim/r07/integrator/results/counter_and_arm_envelopes.json).", '',
